---
const problemRecordSrc = "/assets/home/updated-anesthesia-record.webp?v=20260426";
---

<section class="problem-section" aria-labelledby="home-problem-title">
  <div class="problem-section__inner">
    <div class="problem-section__copy">
      <h2 id="home-problem-title" class="problem-section__title">
        <span class="problem-section__title-line">Your anesthesia record</span>
        <span class="problem-section__title-line hide-on-tablet">shouldn't feel like a liability.</span>
        <span class="problem-section__title-line show-on-tablet">shouldn't feel like</span>
        <span class="problem-section__title-line show-on-tablet">a liability.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="problem-section__body">
        Illegible records are a <strong>medico-legal risk</strong>. Ambiguous timestamps and crossed-out vitals create
        uncertainty when you need clarity most. Bolus ensures every record is crisp,
        professional, and easy to stand behind.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="problem-section__record">
      <img
        src={problemRecordSrc}
        alt="Handwritten anesthesia record"
        width="980"
        height="1305"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
